<title>USA: BNN CORP TO LIST ON GERMAN EXCHANGES.</title>
<headline>BNN CORP TO LIST ON GERMAN EXCHANGES.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>BNN Corp said Wednesday that it has received approval of its listing application for the Frankfurt and Berlin Stock Exchanges, under the symbol BNN.</p>
